      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omuzingo gw'empapura ogukaba niguhurruka omu mwanya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nagaruka naimukya amaiso, narora omuzingo gw'empapura niguhurruka omu mwanya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika yankaguza ati, “Noorora ki?” Namugarukamu, nti, “Nindora omuzingo gw'empapura; obura bwagwo ebigere amakumi asatu, obugazi ikumi na bitaano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha muzingo ogu, “hahandiikirweho omukyeeno ogw'okwizira Ensi yoona. Ha rubaju rwagwo orumu, nihagamba ngu, omusuma weena, naija kubingwa omunsi; kandi ha rubaju orundi, nihagamba ngu, arukurahirra busa, na uwe w'okubingwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe naagamba ati, omukyeno ogu ninyija kugutweka, gutaahe omunju y'omusuma, n'omunju y'ogu anyakurahirra busa ibara lyange; gugiikalemu gugihwerekereze, gumaleho embaaho n'amabaale.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika ogu ayabazaga na nyowe, nubwo yanyiriire haihi yangambira ati, “Imukya amaiso orole ekintu eki ekirukugenda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namukaguza nti, “Baitu kyo kiki?” Yangarukamu ati, “Eki kigega, nikimanyisa ebibi eby'ensi yoona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigega eki, kikaba kiina omuhiiha ogw'isasi, obu nkaba nkyaroleriire, ekigega kyafundukurwa, kwija kurora haikaliiremu omukazi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika yangambira ati, “Omukazi ogu naamanyisa obubi.” Yamusindika hansi omu kigega, yakigarraho omuhiiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naimukya amaiso, narora abakazi babiri baina amapapa makooto nk'ag'ekiidongodongo nibanyiriirra. Baahimba ekigega baahurruka baakitwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo nakagwize malaika nti, “Ekigega nibakitwara nkaha?” Yangarukamu ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nibakitwara Sinara, nuho bakyombekere enju; enju obu erihwa, ekigega eki, bakitahyeemu, nuho kiikale nikiramizibwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
